CauSyncVLA includes portions of OpenPI by Physical Intelligence under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The OpenPI source baseline is revision 215abfb217dbac7d5f1273282331b9b1866c0479. The source distribution retains its license and accompanying Gemma terms. Transformer replacement files retain upstream notices.

CauSyncVLA adds execution-conditioned KV prediction, action-sensitive updater training, action endpoint reuse, and timing/evaluation code. Derived source files are distributed with the modifications in this repository. The OpenPI and LIBERO projects supply the foundation models and simulation benchmark independently.
